  "native_test_names": [
    "native unplaced context binds the session tenant exact registry and sole asset read selector without writes",
    "real placed and explicitly unassigned contexts retain distinct placement heads and nearest-first domains",
    "historical placement pins do not replace the current moved domain or current asset revision",
    "one held native repeatable-read snapshot cannot mix a concurrent committed domain move",
    "missing foreign and stale assets all refuse with version conflict before returning context",
    "every runtime executor refuses the inactive owner loader even with forged session GUCs",
    "revoked private sessions and inactive canonical membership cannot reuse earlier contexts",
    "an expired private session fixture is refused and exact owner restoration recovers the original session",
    "forged owner GUCs cannot retarget context and pooled success restores their exact prior values",
    "restricted retired and source-unavailable metadata remain facts with canonical sorted identities",
    "malformed duplicate and noncanonical ACLs and invalid stored asset versions fail closed",
    "ACL physical overflow fails at the declared bound without partial context",
    "native SQL011 accepts thirty-two domain nodes while excess depth and corrupted cycles are refused"
  ],
